{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Have you ever dreamed of being the villain in a Tower Defense? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Be the one who sends waves and waves of troops to break through the enemy defenses in this Reverse Tower Defense. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Summon, conquer and upgrade your troops to dominate the whole world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413640/extras/conquista_ingles.png?t=1752918389\" /></div>Choose the troops, the order and the path you\u2019ll send in each wave. Think of your strategies to conquer each map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413640/extras/d1d9cdcff4e3270413d52e94a284bf93.poster.avif?t=1752918389\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413640/extras/d1d9cdcff4e3270413d52e94a284bf93.webm?t=1752918389\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413640/extras/d1d9cdcff4e3270413d52e94a284bf93.mp4?t=1752918389\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413640/extras/invasion_ingles.png?t=1752918389\" /></div>Play through the kingdoms, each with their own features. Plains, forest, coast, wasteland, snowed mountains and desert, conquer everything on your own time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413640/extras/6ffdfbdbda1247ad5d5659f496dbcbb8.poster.avif?t=1752918389\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413640/extras/6ffdfbdbda1247ad5d5659f496dbcbb8.webm?t=1752918389\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413640/extras/6ffdfbdbda1247ad5d5659f496dbcbb8.mp4?t=1752918389\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413640/extras/mejoras_ingles.png?t=1752918389\" /></div>Unlock units, choose their profession, upgrade the stats and change their skins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413640/extras/gif_mejoras.gif?t=1752918389\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413640/extras/mapas_ingles.png?t=1752918389\" /></div>Dominate each state of the region, advance without rest with your troops to conquer the whole world. But take care, the states can rebel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413640/extras/gif_conquista.gif?t=1752918389\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Characteristics:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">6 Kingdoms with 46 maps total.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">16 Enemy defenses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">12 Troops to unlock, each with 2 different professions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Many skins to each troop to use at your own liking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">6 Spells to help the units through the waves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A skilltree with more than 50 unlocks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Changing climate, rain, clouds, storm, mist\u2026 you can face many of them in your conquest.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Tortoise formation","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2413640/c7b61b7520285a8f9a3e7e24d178c2a09e53b1cc.jpg"},{"name":"I'm a healer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2413640/2c4864c3c1560484f379c20a2e4f400997728076.jpg"},{"name":"Is it flash?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2413640/d9ce4998cd6419bbe643f0102e28c6ba42fb603b.jpg"},{"name":"All in!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2413640/7bb3b42a85b9e213c59571b9262f8a835ed060cc.jpg"},{"name":"Is that you, Morgana?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2413640/240be4db08d3aa1ee14b4abe431d6a890b2abf4f.jpg"},{"name":"Kat\u014dn: G\u014dkaky\u016b no Jutsu","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2413640/5937c275ebb405c755c72bd470a9001029c5bfcc.jpg"},{"name":"Evil never sleeps","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2413640/546812a9c9e1ad760ca6470b82f8b7aa688259d4.jpg"},{"name":"Let it wave","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2413640/aac6c925377ec7d4d016610a43a6c1a7238e3f15.jpg"},{"name":"I'm the bone of my sword","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2413640/2d7fa46d48122dd714a16b6b80cf6ff6caeda232.jpg"},{"name":"A long scream","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2413640/e8f02433352adb405352dc518b420070a003b2ca.jpg"}],"total":61},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2413640?t=1752918389","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413640/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752918389","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413640/d18303001f91